    "body": "It would be better if all the default logs files can be deleted by running the forget me tool without any additional configurations. This is how its done in APIM\r\n\r\nE.g., \r\n\r\nWe can give the  regex to delete log files as below.  \r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"processors\" : [\r\n    \"log-file\",\r\n    \"rdbms\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"directories\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"dir\": \"log-config\",\r\n      \"type\": \"log-file\",\r\n      \"processor\" : \"log-file\",\r\n       \"log-file-path\" : \"../../../../logs\",\r\n      **\"log-file-name-regex\" : \"(.)*(log|out)\"**\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"dir\": \"sql\",\r\n      \"type\": \"rdbms\",\r\n      \"processor\" : \"rdbms\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"extensions\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"dir\": \"../../../../conf/datasources\",\r\n      \"type\": \"datasource\",\r\n      \"processor\" : \"rdbms\",\r\n      \"properties\" : [\r\n        {\r\n        **\"identity\": \"WSO2AM_DB\",\r\n        \"apim\": \"WSO2AM_DB\",\r\n        \"um\": \"WSO2_CARBON_DB\"**\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}",
